            <ArticleTitle>Treatment leads to significant improvement. Effect of conservative treatment on pain in lymphoedema.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>32-3, 35-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is a common complaint in patients with secondary upper limb lymphoedema related to breast cancer. This study shows how standard conservative treatment of lymphoedema can result in a significant reduction in pain and decreased limb volume.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
